                             "Hello, friend. You look like you could use some fresh milk.", "Howdy. Watch out for the bull."]),
        ("farmer", "chatter", ["Corn's high this year. Highest I've seen.", "Pigs got out again. Third time this week.", "Need rain. Need it bad.",
                               "The crows are smarter than my scarecrow.", "Wheat's coming in golden.", "My mule kicked the fence down. And then me.",
