        ("elder", "greet", ["Ah, a young one. Sit with me a while.", "Hello, dear. Mind your manners.", "In my day, folk said good morning properly.",
                            "Come closer, my eyes aren't what they were.", "Well. Look at you, all grown and dangerous.", "Afternoon. Have you eaten?",
                            "Good day. Have you come to hear a story?", "Ah. You remind me of someone. Can't think who."]),
        ("elder", "chatter", ["I remember when this was all prairie.", "Back then we had real winters. Snow to the rooftops.",
                              "My knees can predict the weather. Rain by supper.", "The young folk don't listen. Never did. Neither did I.",
                              "I knew the man who founded this town. Terrible cook.", "When I was a girl, the river ran the other way. Or so it seemed.",
                              "Ninety years and I've still not seen the sea.", "The old trail went through the canyon. Folk forgot it.",
