        // MARK: The sheriff
        ("sheriff", "greet", ["Evening. You keep the peace, we'll get along fine.", "New in town? I keep a list. You're on it.", "Howdy. Holster stays buttoned in my town.",
                              "Afternoon. Heard you've been busy.", "Good to see you on the right side of the bars."]),
        ("sheriff", "chatter", ["Twenty years with this badge. Tired of it most days.", "I got a jail full of nobody. Suits me.", "The territory's getting meaner.",
